{
  "borough": "London Borough of Barking and Dagenham",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its design and siting, would appear out-keeping with the prevailing character of the surrounding area and result in an increased sense of enclosure by eroding the spaciousness between the two adjacent properties.&amp;nbsp; The proposal would therefore be contrary to the following policies which seek to ensure that developments are sympathetic to local character: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December 2024)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; -Policy D4 of the London Plan (March 2021)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; -Policies SP2 and DMD1 of The Barking and Dagenham Local Plan (September 2024)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;div&gt;The proposed development, by reason of siting, scale and appearance, would result in detrimental harm to the neighbouring property. Specifically, the proposed development would result in an unacceptable material loss of sunlight/daylight, outlook and privacy, and unacceptable overshadowing and overbearing impacts on no.55 Winstead Gardens and a material loss of privacy and overbearing impacts to the rear gardens of no.11 Foxlands Crescent and no.53 Winstead Gardens. The proposal therefore constitutes unneighbourly development which would adversely impact the health and quality of life of neighbouring residents and is contrary to:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (DLUHC, 2024);&lt;br&gt;- Policy D6 of the London Plan (March 2021);&lt;br&gt;- Policy DMD1 of the London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan (September 2024).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
